WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 023. BUNDLED CONSENT HIDES THE DEAL. One yes explains too little.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
SPECIFICITY. SEPARATE EVERY PURPOSE. Each scope needs permission and history.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
EVENTS. RECORD THE TRUTH. Grant and withdrawal form chronological chains.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
WITHDRAWAL. CHANGE WHAT HAPPENS NEXT. Stop future consent-based processing.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
RIGHTS. ROUTE EVERY REQUEST. Assign owner, deadline, status, escalation.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
CONTROL. KEEP A LIVING RECORD. Consent must remain specific and changeable.
